      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLY THE WIND (8) made considerable ground in the run home to finish third last start over 1600m at Taree. Will be hard to hold out again. MILCHEL (6) is yet to break through in eight runs. Finished tenth at his last appearance over 2000m at Canberra on October 23. Well placed on this occasion and gets his chance to break the ice. RAPID REIGNS (2) recorded a gutsy maiden victory last time out over 1600m at Canberra, scoring by a head. Is lightly raced and has plenty of scope for improvement. Looks well placed and he should be in the finish again. CLASSIC TOUCH (3) was below her best last time when seventh over 1600m at Wagga, beaten 8 lengths. Open to improvement and should be about the money.",
